<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia building approvals fall in March.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia building approvals fall in March.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian dwelling unit building approvals fell a seasonally-adjusted 1.8 percent in February to 11,368 from 11,578 in February, compared with 10,441 in March 1996, the Australian Bureau of Statistics said.</p>
<p>Economists on average had expected building approvals to rise 2.0 percent.</p>
</text>
